"id": "4519953588240197", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620965_4519953591573530_8351580382402432369_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=du3lSvbeAPUQ7kNvwE0_NFp&_nc_oc=Adql6TwOQ4hSeeMIak9TtgAGxVsLf5ODfUoZBZhAyq68xbWk4n9whh1T3CNJipY1qaM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-iXOQrHvK6QjNHBpwNbL-x2TayOn-ikv2oM1ry-s7XSA&oe=6A2AC728"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail.png", "id": "2004861133471210", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620856_2004861136804543_1846142582016286006_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IXeR7O1XTG0Q7kNvwGvoTRk&_nc_oc=Adp7yNkZ15TYzPAN_ENKzYJNjGQNbCKz0BvptGJcOvay56I9HcBx6rt5Z7YVOU15cY8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af99cL8AEoTNIAz2KGVuz0j1oKPfOyWW4vwo3rKAJRPjFg&oe=6A2ADC6C"}, "display_name": "Terror Taxi VR", "keywords": ["Taxi", "Simulation", "TaxiDrive", "Zombie", "Car"], "long_description": "Terror Taxi VR, An action-packed driving and shooting game where the meter is running, and so are the undead. Navigate a Zombie infested city, pick up eccentric passengers, and deliver them safely to earn your pay. Defend your cab from zombie creatures using a heavy arsenal of weapons or your gun from glove box . You can Use your hard-earned cash to upgrade your ride.\n\n{1296626568789608}\n\n\ud83d\ude95 The Ultimate VR Taxi Survival: Find fares, collect cash, and navigate the dangerous streets of a monster-filled city.\n\n\ud83d\udd2b Arm Your Cab: Spend your earnings on deadly roof-mounted turrets\u2014including flamethrowers, lasers, and rocket launchers\u2014and deck out your dashboard with custom bobbleheads.\n\n\ud83e\uddfd Immersive VR Interactions: Listen to your quirky passengers, manually operate your turret joystick, and physically scrub the monster blood off your windshield to keep your vision clear.\n\n\ud83d\udcb0 Manage Your Hustle: Every bullet costs money. Balance your ammo spending with your trip earnings to stay profitable and stay alive!\n{4452619345056261}\n{968989105913332}\n\n\n", "short_description": "A taxi driving and shooting VR game where you will play in an open world full of zombies and quests."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.raxsam.info/#privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Raxsam Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://raxsam.info/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1128232047044612"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1307266404717569"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3055784424616508"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "3055784424616508"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1784566800, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1307266404717569"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1148582625009554", "version": "0.0.0.5"}, "id": "984660417644492", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "i